      {
        "index": 1,
        "text": "As the best candidate, I was appointed to collect and evaluate information for a database about diverse natural disasters, such as hurricanes, typhoons or thunderstorms. Sometimes I did this by giving out questionnaires to those who went through them. But sometimes I had to go through actual disasters myself.",
        "zh": "作为最合适的人选，我被指派收集并评估信息，用于一个涵盖各种自然灾害的数据库，例如飓风，台风或雷暴。有时，我通过发放调查问卷来收集信息，对象是经历过这些灾害的人。但有时，我也不得不亲身经历真正的灾难。",
        "start": 3.9266666666666667,
        "voiceEnd": 29.923333333333332,
