      {
        "index": 2,
        "text": "The Musaki Volcano was one of them. At that time, I lived in a bungalow alongside the volcano with a novelist, who came for the appreciation of its eruption. One day, when I was drawing diagrams on the balcony and he was bathing inside, the volcano erupted unexpectedly.",
        "zh": "穆萨基火山事件就是其中一次。当时，我和一位小说家住在火山旁的一栋平房里，他是为了观赏火山喷发而来的。一天，我在阳台画图，他在屋里洗澡，火山突然喷发了。",
