      {
        "index": 3,
        "text": "The ash and lava fountains shooting high in the sky varied from 50 to 100 meters in height. It was absolutely fantastic! I even noticed a rainbow appear in the fog caused by a heat wave.",
        "zh": "喷向高空的火山灰和熔岩喷泉，高度在50到100米之间不等。那景象真是令人惊叹！我甚至看见雾中出现了一道彩虹，那片雾是热浪形成的。",
